#ASSERT `the employer group of` (paper 49999) `on` (Date 15 10 2026) EQUALS `the non-electronic group` -- EG1
#ASSERT `the employer group of` (paper 50000) `on` (Date 15 10 2026) EQUALS `the online group` -- EG2
#ASSERT `the last day to deliver employment income information, employer` (paper 50000) `, payday` (Date 14 10 2026) `, Matariki days` mdays EQUALS Date 16 10 2026 -- EG2 (2 working days)
#ASSERT `the last day to deliver employment income information, employer` (paper 49999) `, payday` (Date 14 10 2026) `, Matariki days` mdays EQUALS Date 29 10 2026 -- EG1 (10 working days)
